{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>更新時間：13:46 2026-10-30 HKT<br/>發佈時間：13:46 2026-10-30 HKT</p>\n<p>發佈時間：13:46 2026-10-30 HKT</p><img alt=\"姚本輝落力督操。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ur/sthl_square/ef767da13e38ddc01883d95080d88eaa/2026-10/179333965150789.jpg\"/><p>姚本輝剛周三沙田全泥宴憑「日馳千里」贏馬，季內累積十場頭馬進佔練馬師榜第五位；今早練者如常緊守崗位，專心督操。</p><p>當「盈好威楓」、「皇龍天將」、「叻叻豬」及「樂勝天下」四匹有程馬快試時，姚本輝均高舉望遠鏡檢視一番，似乎心中有馬，今戰不妨吼實。</p><img alt=\"「叻叻豬」\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/4392ca57242d06f0e30dd8a33f2ed71d/2026-10/179333909016689.jpeg\" title=\"「叻叻豬」\"/><p>「叻叻豬」</p><img alt=\"「皇龍天將」（近鏡）\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/4543d87cb7954792f24b5e79f11e9b10/2026-10/179333909022056.jpeg\" title=\"「皇龍天將」（近鏡）\"/><p>「皇龍天將」（近鏡）</p><img alt=\"「盈好威楓」\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/4ea99ca56de1963b5ae3484ea652ed86/2026-10/179333909079831.jpeg\" title=\"「盈好威楓」\"/><p>「盈好威楓」</p><img alt=\" 「樂勝天下」\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/dbd3b1eed9a5bea495ade96c6e3965bb/2026-10/179333909094221.jpeg\" title=\" 「樂勝天下」\"/><p> 「樂勝天下」</p><p>陳嘉甜<br/> </p><p>最Hit</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-30T06:05:27.449837+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":238,"images":5,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-30T05:46:28+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-30T08:19:38.262880+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-30T06:00:17.696810+00:00","content_hash":"49069024309968d530472eeda0cedc974d6e9ce6d1885918acf20e879d8f4591","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}